WEBVTT

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.650
Momentary highs, traded for the pain of grandmothers and mothers,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.950
for your own humanity, and the love of family and friends —

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.450
losing everything to sink into hallucinations. Is it worth it?

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:33.350
Once you are determined, you have plenty of reasons to refuse.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:39.250
It's about your own resolve in everything: NO means NO.
